{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00638",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 9.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "Doctor, this is Liam. Back from Thailand on Saturday, fever and a rash. His mam's with him. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.83,
      "end_seconds": 17.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Thanks, Niamh. Hello Liam, hello Mrs Doyle. What's been happening? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.51,
      "end_seconds": 22.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Fever. Rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 23.19,
      "end_seconds": 38.39,
      "duration_seconds": 15.2,
      "text": "He's not a man for words, doctor. Let me say it. He's had the fever since he got back, and the rash came out the day after."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.63,
      "end_seconds": 47.0,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Liam, how long have you had the fever, in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.61,
      "end_seconds": 51.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 53.35,
      "end_seconds": 67.83,
      "duration_seconds": 14.48,
      "text": "It's not three days, it's a week. I took his temperature at the airport on the Saturday before last and it was up then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.82,
      "end_seconds": 82.89,
      "duration_seconds": 14.07,
      "text": "So, you say three days, your mother says closer to a week. I'll put that down as three to seven days, and we'll see if we can narrow it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.78,
      "end_seconds": 85.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Feels like three."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.06,
      "end_seconds": 91.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Fair enough. Where's the rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.84,
      "end_seconds": 96.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Chest, back. Bit on my arms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 97.34,
      "end_seconds": 101.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "It's red spots, not itchy, he says."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.49,
      "end_seconds": 108.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Any bleeding, from the gums or nose, or in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.97,
      "end_seconds": 111.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "No. None."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.44,
      "end_seconds": 120.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Are you allergic to any medicines, any allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.76,
      "end_seconds": 123.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.89,
      "end_seconds": 132.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "And are you taking anything at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.01,
      "end_seconds": 142.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Doxycycline, 100 mg once a day, for malaria. I took it all trip. Missed a couple."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 144.74,
      "end_seconds": 150.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "He has tablets left, I saw the packet. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.76,
      "end_seconds": 160.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "What were you up to in Thailand? Any insect bites, rural areas, fresh water swimming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.91,
      "end_seconds": 166.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Beaches. Island. Loads of mosquito bites."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 168.53,
      "end_seconds": 171.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Doctor, his obs. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.34,
      "end_seconds": 176.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Go on, Niamh. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 189.99,
      "end_seconds": 196.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "Temperature 38.6, pulse 104, blood pressure 118 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.23,
      "end_seconds": 202.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Thank you. Liam, let me look at the rash. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.13,
      "end_seconds": 218.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.52,
      "end_seconds": 229.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Fine, flat red spots over the chest and back, and they blanch when I press them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 229.93,
      "end_seconds": 233.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "What does that mean? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.5,
      "end_seconds": 248.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.47,
      "text": "It means the spots fade under pressure, which is a more reassuring sign. But with a fever and recent tropical travel, I can't take chances. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.59,
      "end_seconds": 254.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "What is it? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.38,
      "end_seconds": 266.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "Most likely a viral illness, such as dengue, picked up from the mosquitoes, but I need the experts to look at you today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 268.74,
      "end_seconds": 270.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Today? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.18,
      "end_seconds": 285.09,
      "duration_seconds": 13.91,
      "text": "Yes. I'm going to refer you to the infectious diseases team at the hospital and ring them now, they'll see you this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 287.69,
      "end_seconds": 291.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I'll write out the letter, doctor. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.18,
      "end_seconds": 303.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "Please. Liam, take paracetamol only if you have to, and don't take ibuprofen or aspirin until they've seen you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.58,
      "end_seconds": 308.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 309.8,
      "end_seconds": 312.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I'll drive him up. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.17,
      "end_seconds": 319.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Please do, and go straight there. ~"
    }
  ]
}
